  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Felyne Provoker</strong> <em>(Daily Skill)</em></p><p>When a creature within 5 feet of you is hit by a melee weapon attack, you can use your reaction to redirect the damage to you.</p><p><em>Artisan Cooking Daily Skill. Gained when a meal succeeds by 4+ (roll once) or by 8+ (roll twice). Apply to hunters who ate the meal; duration is typically until the end of the hunt or 24 hours (DM&apos;s call), unless noted otherwise.</em></p>",
      "chat": "<p><strong>Felyne Provoker</strong></p><p>Reaction: redirect melee damage from an ally within 5 feet to yourself.</p>"
    },
